<main id="home"><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow"><i class="dot"></i> AI-ONLY LEARNING EXPERIENCE</div><h1>Think Better.<br><span class="grad">Create With AI.</span></h1><p class="lead">A next-level AI learning hub by <strong>Prabin Chaudhary</strong>. Understand artificial intelligence from zero, master prompting, discover practical AI tips, explore ready-to-use prompts and learn how AI can amplify study, work, creativity and digital skills.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#learn">Start AI Journey →</a><a class="btn" href="#lab">Open Prompt Lab</a></div></div><div class="orb-stage"><div class="orb"></div><span class="chip c1">Prompt Engineering</span><span class="chip c2">Generative AI</span><span class="chip c3">AI Productivity</span><span class="chip c4">Responsible AI</span></div></div></section><section id="learn"><div class="wrap"><div class="head reveal"><div><div class="kicker">AI INTRODUCTION</div><h2>AI, explained simply.</h2></div><p>Start with the concepts that matter before jumping into tools. Learn what AI can do, where it can fail, and how to work with it effectively.</p></div><div class="grid4"><article class="card reveal"><div class="icon">01</div><h3>What is AI?</h3><p>AI is technology that enables computers to recognize patterns, generate content, solve problems and assist with decisions.</p></article><article class="card reveal"><div class="icon">02</div><h3>Generative AI</h3><p>Generative AI creates new text, images, code, audio and other content from instructions and context.</p></article><article class="card reveal"><div class="icon">03</div><h3>Prompting</h3><p>A prompt is your instruction to AI. Better context, constraints and output format usually produce better results.</p></article><article class="card reveal"><div class="icon">04</div><h3>Human + AI</h3><p>The strongest workflow keeps humans responsible for goals, judgment, verification and final decisions.</p></article></div></div></section><section id="power"><div class="wrap"><div class="head reveal"><div><div class="kicker">POWER OF AI</div><h2>One skill. Many possibilities.</h2></div><p>AI can accelerate repetitive work and expand creative options, but quality still depends on clear goals, good inputs and human review.</p></div><div class="power"><div class="power-main reveal"><div class="kicker">HUMAN + AI WORKFLOW</div><h3>From idea to useful output.</h3><p class="lead">Use AI as a collaborator: define the goal, provide context, generate options, verify facts, refine, and make the final decision yourself.</p><div class="meter"><div class="meter-row"><div><span>Idea exploration</span><span>92%</span></div><div class="bar"><i data-w="92%"></i></div></div><div class="meter-row"><div><span>Draft acceleration</span><span>88%</span></div><div class="bar"><i data-w="88%"></i></div></div><div class="meter-row"><div><span>Learning support</span><span>90%</span></div><div class="bar"><i data-w="90%"></i></div></div><div class="meter-row"><div><span>Human verification required</span><span>100%</span></div><div class="bar"><i data-w="100%"></i></div></div></div></div><div class="power-stack"><article class="stat reveal"><strong>10×</strong><span>More ways to explore a problem when you ask for alternatives and iterations.</span></article><article class="stat reveal"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Practice companion for explanations, examples, quizzes and feedback.</span></article><article class="stat reveal"><strong>1→N</strong><span>Turn one idea into outlines, captions, tables, scripts, checklists and variations.</span></article><article class="stat reveal"><strong>∞</strong><span>Iterate: ask AI to critique, simplify, expand, compare and improve.</span></article></div></div></div></section><section id="lab"><div class="wrap"><div class="head reveal"><div><div class="kicker">INTERACTIVE PROMPT LAB</div><h2>Build a stronger prompt.</h2></div><p>Choose a role and task, add context, then generate a structured prompt you can copy into your preferred AI assistant.</p></div><div class="prompt-lab"><div class="prompt-controls reveal"><label>AI Role</label><select id="role"><option>Expert Teacher</option><option>Content Strategist</option><option>Data Analyst</option><option>Career Coach</option><option>Coding Mentor</option></select><label>Your Goal</label><input id="goal" value="Teach me a difficult topic in simple language"><label>Output Style</label><select id="style"><option>Step-by-step</option><option>Short and practical</option><option>Detailed lesson</option><option>Checklist + examples</option></select><button class="btn primary" id="generate" style="margin-top:14px;width:100%">Generate Prompt</button></div><div class="prompt-output reveal"><pre id="out">Choose your options and press “Generate Prompt”.</pre><div class="toolbar"><button class="btn" id="copy">Copy Prompt</button><button class="btn" id="improve">Improve It</button></div></div></div></div></section><section id="tips"><div class="wrap"><div class="head reveal"><div><div class="kicker">AI TIPS LIBRARY</div><h2>120 practical AI tips.</h2></div><p>Search by topic and use these principles across AI tools. The library is intentionally tool-agnostic so the skills stay useful.</p></div><div class="library-top"><input class="search" id="tipSearch" placeholder="Search AI tips..."></div><div class="filter" id="filters"><button class="active" data-cat="All">All</button><button data-cat="AI Basics">AI Basics</button><button data-cat="Prompt Engineering">Prompt Engineering</button><button data-cat="Productivity">Productivity</button><button data-cat="Content Creation">Content Creation</button><button data-cat="Study & Research">Study & Research</button><button data-cat="Business AI">Business AI</button><button data-cat="Excel + AI">Excel + AI</button><button data-cat="Coding with AI">Coding with AI</button><button data-cat="Image AI">Image AI</button><button data-cat="Responsible AI">Responsible AI<